'''Galactic Travel''' (銀河を駆ける, ''Ginga o Kakeru'', '''Running Through the Galaxy''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]].

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

